name Sell twice in a row keeps (and repairs) the Sell label
show-sell IDX
expect-text Button Sell
# A label left on the shared button by an older build:
set-text Button Buy
close-dialog
show-sell IDX
expect-text Button Sell
show-buy IDX
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
show-sell IDX
expect-text Button Sell
show-buy IDX
expect-text Button Buy
cleanup:
close-dialog
